  "title": "Pasta Fazul",
  "description": "An earthy saute of garlic, onion and carrot is seasoned with parsley, basil and oregano, then simmered with tomatoes and cannellini beans. Boiled macaroni, coated with butter and Parmesan cheese, is folded into the simmer to finish the dish.",
